|---|---|---|---|
| 3 (root) | −∞ | yes | 3 |
| 1 | 3 | no | 3 |
| 3 (left leaf) | 3 | yes | 3 |
| 4 | 3 | yes | 4 |
| 1 (under 4) | 4 | no | 4 |
| 5 | 4 | yes | 5 |

